Z||000016||lawrence||12-13-2001||08:05 AM||||Yes, the chin spoiler that Skitime has and I had (sold the car) are the bottom part of an aero nose, turned upside down.  I have a small write-up on what I did:<P> <A HREF="http://www.webelectricmagazine.com/99/1/tte.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.webelectricmagazine.com/99/1/tte.htm</A> <P>It isn't very hard to do, but it isn't a simple bolt-on either.  The cost is quite low since you do it yourself, but you will need some body skills to make the light buckets.<P>Good luck!<P>-L<BR> <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe/products" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe/products</A>  - Sequential Turn Signals<P>||||reg||1
